      "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone,</p><p>I was introduced to this game by a friend and I really loved it so I bought it.&nbsp; I think maybe my friend taught me the rules wrong though, but I'm not sure.&nbsp; On the back of the rule book, where the quickguide for turns is, it says that hero turn consists of playing a card and then playing a power.&nbsp; I know that you can always choose not to do either or both, but is the order of these turns interchangeable?&nbsp; In other words, can you play a power and then play a card?&nbsp; Or do you have to play a card before you play a power, if you indeed do both?</p><p>If this is already posted somewhere, I apologize.</p><p>Thanks for the help!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:52.143Z",
