      "created_at": "2015-02-21T15:59:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s also important to note that you “Play” cards and “Use” powers. So you can play any card (whether “Power” printed on it or not) from your hand during your play phase (unless specified otherwise) and use any one power that you have in play on your power phase.</p>\n<p>I’m not sure if you were doing that or not from your terminology, but I wanted to make sure it was made clear!</p>\n<p>Welcome!</p>",
